[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733070634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120370#issuecomment-4733070634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370","id":4733070634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGhztKg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T16:54:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T16:58:59Z","body":"What do you mean \"but if you make reference to them you get the error\"? Do you mean constructing them or accessing them as singletons?\n\nIf the latter I don't think that's something that was ever meant to be supported, but not sure exactly what would be appropriate here, I don't think these are meant to be exposed in this sense\n\nCan't find anything in beta4 that could possibly have caused this, so not sure if this was intentional, are you sure it doesn't work in beta4? And that it does in beta3?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733070634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733597311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120370#issuecomment-4733597311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370","id":4733597311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGiT2fw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T17:47:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T17:47:39Z","body":"So I was right, this was not from beta4, it starts in rc1, so is probably from:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120028\n\nCC @HolonProduction \n\nNot sure if this part was intentional, though these classes *do* show up in the suggestions so it is a bit confusing, I suspect the error is that they show up there rather than that they don't work\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4733597311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734193232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120370#issuecomment-4734193232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370","id":4734193232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGi4OUA","user":{"login":"bitwes","id":1156520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTY1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1156520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes","html_url":"https://github.com/bitwes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T19:00:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T19:00:54Z","body":"Sorry for the confusion, \n\n> \"but if you make reference to them you get the error\"\n\nI just meant making a reference to them in a script would cause a parser error.  In my case it is in a dictionary:\n```\n{...\"IPUnix\": IPUnix, ...}\n```\n> So I was right, this was not from beta4, it starts in rc1\n\nI hadn't tested GUT against any 4.7 release since beta 3, so I only knew that it was since beta 3 and either in rc 3 or before.\n\nIf there was a flag that could be checked to exclude these types of classes (if they should remain in `get_class_list`) that would be helpful.  Another approach that would help in my case is to have `ClassDB` have a method that returns a class/script based on a string.  That would alleviate my need to construct this dictionary.  Something like `ClassDB.get_class(\"AStar2D\")` which would return `AStar2D`.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4734193232/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738858746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120370#issuecomment-4738858746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370","id":4738858746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGnU--g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T06:54:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T06:54:37Z","body":"ClassDB has an `is_exposed` flag for classes. For all those classes you mention `is_exposed` is `false`. (As you figured those are internal platform specific implementations.) Not sure why the exposed methods on `ClassDB` would include internal classes though 🤔\n\n> ..., though these classes _do_ show up in the suggestions so it is a bit confusing, ...\n\nFixes for that are pending but did not make it into 4.7. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119936 https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119691\n\n---\n\nWorkaround wise, your best bet would probably be a whitelist based on the documentation xml. Since internal classes are correctly filtered out of the doc system.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4738858746/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741828027","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120370#issuecomment-4741828027","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370","id":4741828027,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGqKNuw","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/o